  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ODA - Conciliation Resources Funding: Process Support Evidence, Analysis and Advisory Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve real working practice of those involved in peace processes and mediation in priority contexts through research, evidence and Monitoring Evaluation and Learning (MEL). 

The project will strengthen the ability of local and international peace actors - diplomats, mediators, conflict parties and civil society - to design, negotiate and implement impactful peace and dialogue processes by providing high-quality evidence, analysis and exchange, and innovative policy and technical support.</narrative>
  </description>
